{"slug":"lou-correa","qid":"Q6685454","name":"Lou Correa","desc":"American politician in California (born 1958)","article":"Lou Correa","born":"1958-01-24","died":null,"birthplace":"Los Angeles","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"CA-46","f":2017,"u":null},{"t":"State Senate of California","w":"","f":2006,"u":2014},{"t":"California State Assembly","w":"","f":1998,"u":2004}],"summary":"Jose Luis Correa ( kə-RAY-ə; born January 24, 1958) is an American businessman and politician serving as the U.S. representative for California's 46th congressional district since 2017. His district serves most of the majority-Hispanic areas of Orange County and includes most of Anaheim, all of Santa Ana, and parts of Orange. A member of the Democratic Party, Correa represented the 34th district in the California State Senate from 2006 to 2014.","photo":{"f":"lou-correa.jpg","by":"Leah Herman, House Creative Services","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lou_Correa_118th_Congress_(mid-cropped).jpg"},"history":[{"y":2026,"o":"H","k":"CA-46","p":"D","n":"Lou Correa","race":"CA-46"},{"y":2024,"o":"H","k":"CA-46","p":"D","v":134013,"s":63.43,"w":true,"n":"J. Luis Correa"},{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"CA-46","p":"D","v":78041,"s":61.79,"w":true,"n":"J Luis Correa"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"CA-46","p":"D","v":157803,"s":68.75,"w":true,"n":"J Luis Correa"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"CA-46","p":"D","v":102278,"s":69.15,"w":true,"n":"Lou Correa"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"CA-46","p":"D","v":115248,"s":70.02,"w":true,"n":"Lou Correa"}]}